---
title: vote.final=final のとき同票で revote なしで即 tiebreaker (draw)
setup: { werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  vote.final: final
  vote.tiebreaker: draw
  general.first-victim: none
---
# 3 人村で 3-way 同票 → revote 0 回 (maxRevotes=0) → 即 tiebreaker (draw) で終局。
# vote.final=revote (default) との対比シナリオ。

++Alice、Bob、Carol
!Alice=人狼
!Bob=村人
!Carol=村人

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace (general.first-victim=none かつ襲撃なし)
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Bob→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# vote tally: Alice 1 / Bob 1 / Carol 1 → 3-way 同票 → 即 draw (revote なし)
# == end ==

# @expect-result: draw
# @expect-finished: true
